  "question": {
    "text": "If the tangent to the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;at a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> on it is parallel to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then:",
